  "description" : "<notes xmlns=\"http://www.sbml.org/sbml/level2\">      <p xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">    The model reproduces active Caspase-3 time profile corresponding to the total Apaf-1 value of 20 nM as depicted in Fig 2-A . The model was successfully tested on MathSBML.</p>          </notes>",
